#: includes/class-admin.php:1092
msgid "Stay ahead of every deadline"
msgstr "Adelántate a cada plazo"

#: includes/class-admin.php:1095
msgid "Post meeting notices with a countdown, and get reminders until they're up."
msgstr "Publica los avisos de reunión con cuenta regresiva y recibe recordatorios hasta que estén publicados."

#: includes/class-admin.php:1096
msgid "Let owners request a login, and approve it in one click."
msgstr "Deja que los propietarios pidan acceso y apruébalo con un clic."

#: includes/class-admin.php:1097
